# The Beschreibungsstandard grammar is embedded in the binary and its exact bytes are pinned by
# CanonicalDtd.ExpectedSha256. Line-ending conversion on commit would change those bytes and the
# self-check would then refuse to run. Treating it as binary removes the possibility entirely.
*.dtd binary

# Fixture exports are compared byte for byte by the DTD-copy tests; normalising them would make
# those tests assert something other than what they claim.
tests/GoBd.Validation.Tests/Fixtures/** binary
